    "text": "In the diagram given below, there are three lenses formed. Considering negligible thickness of each of them as compared to $\\left|R_1\\right|$ and $\\left|R_2\\right|$, i.e., the radii of curvature for upper and lower surfaces of the glass lens, the power of the combination is\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/nXwOYiQ2JovXzngwRmJKO9KcCEn_br8suPaxUpAbPt8.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>",
    "image": null
